        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game allows players to take on the role of Jiang Wei, a Shu Kingdom general from the Three Kingdoms era, following an adapted version of the &quot;Tale of Jiang Wei.&quot; Originally released about two to three years ago as a WeChat Mini Program, the game is now relaunching on Steam due to popular demand from players.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178940/extras/ccd526b7b68919086ae0d6b9d37c30c1.avif?t=1764948431\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After collecting the three chests in the starting area, you can leave. Click the quick-travel button on the interface to instantly reach shops or the city gates.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178940/extras/31fb701337d313435ce2474367585387.avif?t=1764948431\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The art style, like several other games in the series, features pixel-art renditions of classic Three Kingdoms characters.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178940/extras/47cd079993bc1441406adb43794bb068.avif?t=1764948431\" width=1560 height=878 /></span> The combat system uses a side-scrolling turn-based format—engage in battles by colliding with enemies on the map.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178940/extras/77fd1582444ba62e1d645e19bbc5d29b.avif?t=1764948431\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many hidden chests containing money and equipment, so be sure to search for them!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178940/extras/6b3d6bdd49351d75e751a2bc552058b3.avif?t=1764948431\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game’s world map can be found by searching for &quot;Jiang Wei’s Campaign Map&quot; in the official WeChat account <i>抓狗离 </i>A preview image is provided here, but the full-sized map isn’t visible on the details page—players will need to check the official account for the complete version.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178940/extras/cc71f56437bcb440c95c26fd0f7b70ff.avif?t=1764948431\" width=1080 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story progresses, players make choices that determine which generals join their team, gradually expanding their roster. The main characters focus on Shu Kingdom’s late-era generals, complemented by a wide array of skills and equipment to enrich gameplay.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178940/extras/b39ff5ac580bdb6b91605a3ab34b4cb5.avif?t=1764948431\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game allows players to take on the role of Jiang Wei, a Shu Kingdom general from the Three Kingdoms era, following an adapted version of the &quot;Tale of Jiang Wei.&quot; Originally released about two to three years ago as a WeChat Mini Program, the game is now relaunching on Steam due to popular demand from players.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178940/extras/ccd526b7b68919086ae0d6b9d37c30c1.avif?t=1764948431\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After collecting the three chests in the starting area, you can leave. Click the quick-travel button on the interface to instantly reach shops or the city gates.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178940/extras/31fb701337d313435ce2474367585387.avif?t=1764948431\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The art style, like several other games in the series, features pixel-art renditions of classic Three Kingdoms characters.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178940/extras/47cd079993bc1441406adb43794bb068.avif?t=1764948431\" width=1560 height=878 /></span> The combat system uses a side-scrolling turn-based format—engage in battles by colliding with enemies on the map.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178940/extras/77fd1582444ba62e1d645e19bbc5d29b.avif?t=1764948431\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many hidden chests containing money and equipment, so be sure to search for them!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178940/extras/6b3d6bdd49351d75e751a2bc552058b3.avif?t=1764948431\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game’s world map can be found by searching for &quot;Jiang Wei’s Campaign Map&quot; in the official WeChat account <i>抓狗离 </i>A preview image is provided here, but the full-sized map isn’t visible on the details page—players will need to check the official account for the complete version.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178940/extras/cc71f56437bcb440c95c26fd0f7b70ff.avif?t=1764948431\" width=1080 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story progresses, players make choices that determine which generals join their team, gradually expanding their roster. The main characters focus on Shu Kingdom’s late-era generals, complemented by a wide array of skills and equipment to enrich gameplay.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178940/extras/b39ff5ac580bdb6b91605a3ab34b4cb5.avif?t=1764948431\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p>",
        "short_description": "《三国志之姜维传》是一款致敬《曹操传》的像素风回合战棋RPG！化身蜀汉末期悲情英雄姜维，在复古像素战场上运筹帷幄。体验深度改编的《姜维传》史诗剧情，感受蜀汉最后的坚守与北伐的壮烈。丰富技能体系带来多变策略组合，地形、兵种、走位考验你的智慧。重温经典战棋魅力，书写荡气回肠的三国终章！",
